## Requirements

- Kubernetes {{ template "chart.kubeVersion" . }}
- Helm 4.x, or Helm 3.18+

## Installing

```console
helm install appwrite oci://ghcr.io/levivannoort/charts/appwrite \
  --namespace appwrite --create-namespace
```

## Uninstalling

```console
helm uninstall appwrite --namespace appwrite
```

